[gd_scene format=3]
; CPUParticles2D local_coords on a normal-mapped particle: both emitters are turned a quarter turn
; and draw the same CanvasTexture, whose flat normal map tilts to +x. Global draws at the canvas
; transform (renderer_canvas_cull.cpp:267), so its normal does not turn. Local turns it with the
; emitter. No other scene lights a normal-mapped particle.

